# Whitelist-first: ignore everything by default, un-ignore exactly what is versioned.
*
!.gitignore
!.opencode/
!.opencode/**
!.python-version
!LICENSE
!README.md
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!loader/
!loader/**
!tests/
!tests/**
# Re-ignore runtime artifacts that live inside whitelisted dirs
**/__pycache__/
loader/model_configs.json
dynamic_loader.log